---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[])"
---
Develop and export Sony ARW photos with the same core as the Yellowmoon app

Usage: ym [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  render  Develop and export photos. Defaults match the app: automatic development and the default look. Options change them for this run only
  info    Print metadata and the automatic estimates without rendering
  looks   Manage the look library
  lenses  Show the lenses that `ym render --lens` can give a photo
  doctor  Print the diagnostics that go into a bug report
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Exit codes: 0 every file done, 1 some files failed, 2 usage error, 3 a look is missing, 4 no usable GPU (--require-gpu), 5 no input files, 130 interrupted.
